From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Murgola <andy@murgo.la>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:37:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] moe: expert use profile kept across runs, seeds the cache
 and tracks hit rates

--moe-profile PATH saves how often each expert of each host layer was routed to
(halved as counts grow, so old runs fade) and the next run seeds the MoE cache
with the most used experts before the first token, uploaded through the
stager. Cache stats are logged every 4096 slot-map copies, so a hard-killed
server still reports its hit rate.
